  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Bubble Gubbies Aquarium was founded in [redacted], on [redacted], January
    17th and had their grand opening on May 14th, [redacted] due to some minor setbacks
    while setting up their habitats. Their popularity skyrocketed amongst both tourists
    and locals, and they were even able to launch their own merchandise.  \r\n \r\nOn
    December [redacted], [redacted], one of the many watertanks within their habitats
    broke down. This was caused by a earthquake that happend that day. After the
    earthquake calmed down, visitors noticed a \"odd\" smell in the air and a increase
    of bubbles into the visable tanks of the wateranimals. The building got quickly
    shut down because the gas was a danger to the public.\n \r\nLater, on September
    4th, [redacted], The building got re-opened under new management, they kept the
    original name of the original aquarium and decided to clean out all the old machinery
    and replaced it with new stuff. They re-used the old habitats to host new wildlife,
    thinking that the gas leaks were fixed, and everything would be fine. The aquarium
    re-opened on March 15th, [redacted]. \r\n \r\nThe aquarium got a lot of attraction
    again, however not as much as before it closed and re-opened, due to the history
    of what had happened. The aquarium was open for a few months before it was permanently
    shut down for undisclosed reasons. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f3c92a47edcce53459e77febc1d3d8f1, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 1935764149340499725, guid: f3c92a47edcce53459e77febc1d3d8f1, type: 2}
